    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d335">

                <pb facs="0320" n="300" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg300"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Stoeckl to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="julian gregorian" when="1864-06-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 5–17, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of State</hi>: I have the honor to
                    transmit to you a copy, hereto annexed, of a new regulation concerning merchant
                    vessels of all nations which may arrive at Cronstadt. This special law is
                    intended for the benefit of the municipal revenues of Cronstadt for the
                    cleansing of vessels.</p>
                <p>I pray you, Mr. Secretary of State, to be so good as to order the publication of
                    this regulation through the proper channel.</p>
                <p>Please accept, Mr. Secretary of State, the assurance of my high
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>STOECKL.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d335-a1.xml" xpointer="d335-a1"/>
            </div>
